window.FY_BODY={"id":"2017-12-02_a-member-of-society","subtitle":"","subtitleZh":"","excerpt":"(I) Once silence is pumped in the waterline slowly rises the price of reducing the risk of running aground: a slide into the abyssal zone of feeling (II) Even when it presents…","excerptZh":"（一） 沉默注入后 水位逐渐升高 作为降低触礁风险的代价滑入 情绪的深海区 （二） 即使以混沌示人 时序图中仍然有K线滋长 （三） 存活是个恶劣的字眼！…","htmlEn":"<h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm1\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(I)</span></h2><p>Once silence is pumped in<br>the waterline slowly rises<br>the price of reducing the risk of running aground:<br>a slide into the abyssal zone of feeling</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm2\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(II)</span></h2><p>Even when it presents itself as chaos<br>candlesticks keep sprouting<br>across the time-series chart</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm3\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(III)</span></h2><p>Survival is a vile word!<br>The decent surrender their restraint to it<br>the shameless grow fouler still</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm4\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(IV)</span></h2><p>Only when things grow dull<br>does my gaze grow clearer, more sincere<br>answer resentment with rectitude<br>answer enmity with resentment<br>an underdog should have an underdog&#x27;s way of staying alive</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm5\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(V)</span></h2><p>The first resurrection put me fast asleep in the morning<br>the second ought to wake me early in the night</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm6\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(VI)</span></h2><p>Action is one way of doing evil but<br>action is also one way of purging sin<br>without action, nothing counts<br>greed turns us against<br>covalent bonds</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm7\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(VII)</span></h2><p>There are earthquakes everywhere<br>but, thinking it over,<br>nothing is worth setting one off</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm8\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(VIII)</span></h2><p>Over the manicured lawn that afternoon<br>hung the distinctive fragrance<br>of life severed at the waist</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"en-lm9\"><span class=\"lm-no\">(IX)</span></h2><p>What, after all, is my loyalty to you—<br>a miracle born of faith or<br>faith born of a miracle<br><br><em>Originally written in Chinese. This article is translated by GPT-5.6.</em></p>","htmlZh":"<h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm1\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（一）</span></h2><p>沉默注入后<br>水位逐渐升高<br>作为降低触礁风险的代价滑入<br>情绪的深海区</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm2\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（二）</span></h2><p>即使以混沌示人<br>时序图中仍然有K线滋长</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm3\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（三）</span></h2><p>存活是个恶劣的字眼！<br>拥有美德的因它放弃矜持<br>不知廉耻的变得更加猥琐</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm4\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（四）</span></h2><p>唯当事情变得无趣起来<br>我的眼神剔透得愈发真诚<br>以直报怨<br>以怨报仇<br>下狗就该有下狗的生存方式</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm5\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（五）</span></h2><p>第一次复活让我在早晨沉沉睡去<br>第二次复活理应让我在夜晚早早醒来</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm6\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（六）</span></h2><p>行动是一种作恶但<br>行动也是一种净罪<br>不行动就什么也不算<br>贪婪让我们对共价键<br>心生敌意</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm7\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（七）</span></h2><p>到处都在地震<br>但仔细想来<br>却并没有什么值得引发地震</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm8\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（八）</span></h2><p>午后精心修剪的草坪上<br>有着被拦腰截断的生命<br>特有的馨香</p><h2 class=\"lm lm-sec\" id=\"zh-lm9\"><span class=\"lm-no\">（九）</span></h2><p>我对你的忠诚到底算是<br>因信仰引发的奇迹还是<br>因奇迹引发的信仰</p>","landmarksEn":{"kind":"sections","marks":[{"id":"en-lm1","kind":"sec","label":"(I)","title":"","peek":"Once silence is pumped in","minute":0},{"id":"en-lm2","kind":"sec","label":"(II)","title":"","peek":"Even when it presents itself as chaos","minute":0.3},{"id":"en-lm3","kind":"sec","label":"(III)","title":"","peek":"Survival is a vile word!","minute":0.4},{"id":"en-lm4","kind":"sec","label":"(IV)","title":"","peek":"Only when things grow dull","minute":0.6},{"id":"en-lm5","kind":"sec","label":"(V)","title":"","peek":"The first resurrection put me fast asleep in the morning","minute":0.9},{"id":"en-lm6","kind":"sec","label":"(VI)","title":"","peek":"Action is one way of doing evil but","minute":1.1},{"id":"en-lm7","kind":"sec","label":"(VII)","title":"","peek":"There are earthquakes everywhere","minute":1.4},{"id":"en-lm8","kind":"sec","label":"(VIII)","title":"","peek":"Over the manicured lawn that afternoon","minute":1.5},{"id":"en-lm9","kind":"sec","label":"(IX)","title":"","peek":"What, after all, is my loyalty to you—","minute":1.7}]},"landmarksZh":{"kind":"sections","marks":[{"id":"zh-lm1","kind":"sec","label":"（一）","title":"","peek":"沉默注入后","minute":0},{"id":"zh-lm2","kind":"sec","label":"（二）","title":"","peek":"即使以混沌示人","minute":0.2},{"id":"zh-lm3","kind":"sec","label":"（三）","title":"","peek":"存活是个恶劣的字眼！","minute":0.4},{"id":"zh-lm4","kind":"sec","label":"（四）","title":"","peek":"唯当事情变得无趣起来","minute":0.6},{"id":"zh-lm5","kind":"sec","label":"（五）","title":"","peek":"第一次复活让我在早晨沉沉睡去","minute":0.9},{"id":"zh-lm6","kind":"sec","label":"（六）","title":"","peek":"行动是一种作恶但","minute":1.1},{"id":"zh-lm7","kind":"sec","label":"（七）","title":"","peek":"到处都在地震","minute":1.4},{"id":"zh-lm8","kind":"sec","label":"（八）","title":"","peek":"午后精心修剪的草坪上","minute":1.6},{"id":"zh-lm9","kind":"sec","label":"（九）","title":"","peek":"我对你的忠诚到底算是","minute":1.8}]}};
